  "description": "VOGNIQ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C54 H115 Co3 Gd3 N3 O25 2+,2(N1 O3 1-),2(H2 O1),2(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Co1 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Co2 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Co3 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Gd1 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.305-3.985 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 98.98-111.13°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [(CoIII)3Gd3(μ3-OH)4(O2CtBu)6(L)3](NO3)2·2CH3CN·2H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula). Article name explicitly identifies Co(III).",
